  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Whether it’s headlining sun-kissed events like The Opening 2026 at Naô Pool Club and the FITZ Opening Party, both in Mallorca, or the Pacha Grand Closing Weekend, taking the Solid Grooves party to New York, Valencia, and Barcelona, or DJing his GOLFOS parties with Dennis Cruz, London’s PAWSA powered through another year, unleashing his trademark rolling, stripped back, groove-based tech-house wherever he went.\n\nAnd when he wasn’t playing it, he was making it, appearing on the Solid Grooves ‘Ibiza Sampler 2026’ with his super-catchy, super-slick ‘Ride On Me’ single in early June, just in time for the summer season.",
